it was so long ago I don't remember that.

00:48:41.610 --> 00:48:45.050
So it was our, this story
happens and it is not a story.

00:48:45.050 --> 00:48:46.770
This is a true event.

00:48:46.770 --> 00:48:49.780
A matter of fact, I
