00:48:49.780 --> 00:48:51.240
So I wouldn't forget any of it.

00:48:51.240 --> 00:48:53.870
And to lend credibility to it.

00:48:53.870 --> 00:48:55.770
I didn't wanna forget anything.

00:48:55.770 --> 00:49:00.760
And Christy had a more direct experience

00:49:00.760 --> 00:49:01.850
