00:49:01.850 --> 00:49:05.430
So I wanted to make sure
that her story came through

00:49:06.300 --> 00:49:09.900
correctly and not in any way, embellished.

00:49:09.900 --> 00:49:12.020
This is how the things happened.

00:49:12.020 --> 00:49:15.333
We'd gotten pretty good at
camping by our last night.

00:49:16.180 --> 00:49:18.530
Like I said, we went outside of Vegas.

00:49:18.530 --> 00:49:21.570
We were looking forward to
finding a campsite earlier

00:49:21.570 --> 00:49:23.510
and then also leaving
later the next morning,

00:49:23.510 --> 00:49:25.930
like to really be at a leisurely pace

00:49:25.930 --> 00:49:27.090
and still be able to get home

00:49:27.090 --> 00:49:29.640
before I have to return
this thing at five o'clock.

00:49:30.970 --> 00:49:35.690
So we went up into this
Lovell Canyon Road.

00:49:35.690 --> 00:49:39.700
It's actually, it's a road
in the middle of nowhere

00:49:39.700 --> 00:49:41.450
on the backside of that mountain range

00:49:41.450 --> 00:49:44.120
that overlooks Las Vegas.

00:49:44.120 --> 00:49:45.270
You can't see anything.

00:49:45.270 --> 00:49:47.050
I mean, it took a long
time to get up there.

00:49:47.050 --> 00:49:51.480
Once you're gonna, once
you get on that road,

00:49:51.480 --> 00:49:56.480
