00:50:04.170 --> 00:50:05.003
We saw a couple of people,

00:50:05.003 --> 00:50:08.490
but the one I was going
for was way far in there.

00:50:08.490 --> 00:50:11.340
And we wanted cell service.

00:50:11.340 --> 00:50:13.633
So I went, as far as we could
go, we lost cell service.

00:50:13.633 --> 00:50:16.300
Then we came back and I saw one campsite

00:50:16.300 --> 00:50:19.030
that was up on this berm in
the middle of this valley,

00:50:19.030 --> 00:50:24.030
this amazing berm where we drove off of,

00:50:24.290 --> 00:50:26.120
it was actually a paved road.

00:50:26.120 --> 00:50:27.220
Did I say that it was like,

00:50:27.220 --> 00:50:29.740
it was asphalt the main
road through the thing.

00:50:29.740 --> 00:50:32.050
So it was like accessible,

00:50:32.050 --> 00:50:33.440
more accessible than other places.

00:50:33.440 --> 00:50:36.126
But then once you go off
of that on the dirt road,

00:50:36.126 --> 00:50:36.959
like I was like,

00:50:36.959 --> 00:50:37.810
I'm gonna put it in four wheel drive

00:50:37.810 --> 00:50:41.100
because I just don't know
like going over these rocks.

00:50:41.100 --> 00:50:43.060
It was not a smooth road at all.

00:50:43.060 --> 00:50:44.210
It wasn't a gravel road,

00:50:44.210 --> 00:50:48.870
it was borderline off-road
off-roading right there.

00:50:48.870 --> 00:50:50.730
But it wasn't far that

00:50:51.904 --> 00:50:55.253
we would go off the paved
road, we would go up this berm,

00:50:57.860 --> 00:51:00.760
maybe 400 yards.

00:51:00.760 --> 00:51:03.480
And there was a campsite
that had this amazing vista

00:51:04.650 --> 00:51:05.880
on both sides.

00:51:05.880 --> 00:51:07.540
We had cell service, but I looked,

00:51:07.540 --> 00:51:09.610
and there was down a little saddle,

00:51:09.610 --> 00:51:13.580
further on the off-roading and
back up like 200 yards away.

00:51:13.580 --> 00:51:16.112
There was another, it
dipped down and went back up

00:51:16.112 --> 00:51:16.945
and there was another berm.

00:51:16.945 --> 00:51:20.890
And so I drove over there and
it just wasn't flat enough.

00:51:20.890 --> 00:51:23.670
I'd learned that like,
if you don't park flat,

00:51:23.670 --> 00:51:26.110
you don't sleep flat and that's,

00:51:26.110 --> 00:51:27.460
it really compromises
your ability to sleep.

00:51:27.460 --> 00:51:29.927
Did they not give you the
little blocks to balance?

00:51:29.927 --> 00:51:32.130
No, no blocks.

00:51:32.130 --> 00:51:33.270
I took those with me.

00:51:33.270 --> 00:51:34.520
Those proved to be--

00:51:34.520 --> 00:51:37.330
I underestimated, like
people are leaving reviews

00:51:37.330 --> 00:51:39.520
