For a tent that's really important.

00:51:43.150 --> 00:51:46.860
But when you have a van or
you got the rooftop tent,

00:51:46.860 --> 00:51:49.540
I just bought like 30 bucks on Amazon,

00:51:49.540 --> 00:51:51.320
these blocks that you can stack

00:51:51.320 --> 00:51:52.153
and all these different ways.

00:51:52.153 --> 00:51:54.480
And I use them literally
every single night

00:51:54.480 --> 00:51:58.030
