she's knows the way to my heart.

00:52:48.900 --> 00:52:49.733
Wow.

00:52:49.733 --> 00:52:51.300
Yeah, pretty great, huh?

00:52:51.300 --> 00:52:52.830
We're having a great time,

00:52:52.830 --> 00:52:56.360
we're listening to Sea Change by Beck.

